{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEFINITIVE ARCADE RACER FOR VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through neon cities, alien worlds, and orbital circuits. Lean into every turn using intuitive chest-based controls designed for comfort and immersion. Outrun missiles, drop mines, and blast your way to victory\u2014this is VR racing at full throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/c13d997f43a0542876ce522c5911c524.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/c13d997f43a0542876ce522c5911c524.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/c13d997f43a0542876ce522c5911c524.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 SEVEN GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo, competitive, or chaotic\u2014choose from Time Trial, Weekly Challenge, Combat, Survivor, Neon Runner, Multiplayer, and Career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/8452e7a0353e9efdbd698c36f35e84c1.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/8452e7a0353e9efdbd698c36f35e84c1.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/8452e7a0353e9efdbd698c36f35e84c1.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf10 MULTIPLAYER &amp; SOCIAL HUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race with up to 6 players in cross-platform online multiplayer. Choose your avatar and meet up in a social lobby between sessions. \u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/b8de7fbf45f0ecb851e222205cd9ce50.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/b8de7fbf45f0ecb851e222205cd9ce50.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/b8de7fbf45f0ecb851e222205cd9ce50.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0c 30 TRACKS ACROSS THE GALAXY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e Race through highland valleys, desert colonies, neon-lit cities, and orbital spaceways. Each circuit offers unique challenges, visual styles, and hazards to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/bd3b00ae7da9cef417d5c0b825dea898.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/bd3b00ae7da9cef417d5c0b825dea898.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/bd3b00ae7da9cef417d5c0b825dea898.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 COMBAT RACING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use missiles, drones, EMPs, and more in fast-paced battles where every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 LIVERY EDITOR &amp;  SHOWROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom bikes, suits, and helmets in full VR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 PHOTO &amp; REPLAY TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause time mid-race, fly through your replay, and capture your best moments from any angle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/f134fec42a84fafb81da32efa00319ca.avif?t=1751585393\" width=800 height=450 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/668430?t=1751585393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/ec1e53f24aae2beefe3a31542e09e6c26a497253/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751585393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/53c57e9231fd9ae3d8a09f4ceb50762a1c0d3c0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751585393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/53c57e9231fd9ae3d8a09f4ceb50762a1c0d3c0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751585393","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Trac